  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hfu - Insitutional cooperation Indonesia Oceans for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Norway is one of the key institutions in the bilateral institutional cooperation with Indonesia in the Oceans for Development Programme, focusing on Ocean Accounting. Statistics Norway will have close collaboration with BPS and MMAF in Indonesia, as well as coordinating its activities with GOAP project in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
